---
// WhatMatters.astro
// Drop this component anywhere in your main page
---

<section class="pillars">
    <p class="section-label">What matters to me</p>
    <div class="grid">
  
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon icon-teal">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M12 3a12 12 0 0 0 8.5 3a12 12 0 0 1 -8.5 15a12 12 0 0 1 -8.5 -15a12 12 0 0 0 8.5 -3"/>
            <path d="M12 11m-1 0a1 1 0 1 0 2 0a1 1 0 1 0 -2 0"/>
            <path d="M12 12l0 2.5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="card-title">I build secure software</p>
        <p class="card-body">
          Security isn't something I add at the end. I learn and apply it from the start,
          so the people who use what I build are protected.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon icon-amber">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M19.5 12.572l-7.5 7.428l-7.5 -7.428a5 5 0 1 1 7.5 -6.566a5 5 0 1 1 7.5 6.572"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="card-title">I care about impact</p>
        <p class="card-body">
          I choose projects that help people or the environment. My work should do some
          good — not just function correctly.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon icon-blue">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M3 17l4 -4l4 4l4 -8l4 4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="card-title">I'm growing on purpose</p>
        <p class="card-body">
          Moving from software engineering into cybersecurity is an intentional choice.
          I want to understand how systems fail so I can help build ones that don't.
        </p>
      </div>
  
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <style>
    .pillars {
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .section-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary, #888);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  
    .card {
      background: var(--color-bg-secondary, #f5f5f5);
      border: 0.5px solid var(--color-border, #e0e0e0);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .card-icon {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
  
    .icon-teal {
      background: #E1F5EE;
      color: #0F6E56;
    }
  
    .icon-amber {
      background: #FAEEDA;
      color: #854F0B;
    }
  
    .icon-blue {
      background: #E6F1FB;
      color: #185FA5;
    }
  
    .card-title {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  
    .card-body {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary, #666);
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin: 0;
    }
  </style>